   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Kassel, GERMANY: A visitor looks at the work "Phantom Truck" (2007) by Spanish artist Inigo Manglano-Ovalle exhibited at the documenta 12 art fair, 16 June 2007 in Kassel, central Germany. The 12th documenta, one of the world's most important exhibitions of contemporary art, runs from 16 June to 23 September 2007. AFP PHOTO BARBARA SAX  (Photo credit should read BARBARA SAX/AFP/Getty Images)</rdf:li>
